WEBVTT

00:07:28.402 --> 00:07:31.989
then grind them
into a powder-like consistency

00:07:32.031 --> 00:07:34.450
and substitute some
of the cake flour in a recipe

00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:35.951
for that pretzel powder.

00:07:37.036 --> 00:07:38.204
It's pretty good.

00:07:39.872 --> 00:07:43.709
When I was opening Milk Bar,
I knew I wanted to serve ice cream.

00:07:43.751 --> 00:07:45.753
A rebellious kind of ice cream.

00:07:45.794 --> 00:07:47.421
No surprise, right?

00:07:47.463 --> 00:07:49.840
So I decided to buy a soft serve machine,

00:07:49.882 --> 00:07:52.718
which for the record,
was very rebellious at the time.

00:07:53.761 --> 00:07:55.804
I had to decide what flavor to make.

00:07:57.389 --> 00:08:01.268
I mean, why do we only accept
chocolate and vanilla